  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Life Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8f/Akemura_with_Magatsumi_%28Kagurabachi%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260525085452\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Akemura with Magatsumi (Kagurabachi)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8f/Akemura_with_Magatsumi_%28Kagurabachi%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20260525085452\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8f/Akemura_with_Magatsumi_%28Kagurabachi%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20260525085452 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8f/Akemura_with_Magatsumi_%28Kagurabachi%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260525085452 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Akemura with Magatsumi (Kagurabachi)\" width=\"270\" height=\"280\" data-image-key=\"Akemura_with_Magatsumi_%28Kagurabachi%29.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Akemura with Magatsumi (Kagurabachi).jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Magatsumi (Kagurabachi) is an Enchanted Blade that passively absorbs the life and vitality of all living things in the vicinity and grants it to its user.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb life itself.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb life itself and utilize it in someway</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Connection\" title=\"Life Connection\">Life Connection</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Absorption\" title=\"Death Absorption\">Death Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLife_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Life Essence Absorption</li>\n<li>Life Assimilation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLife_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb the essence/nature of life itself, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by <a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Enhanced\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Enhanced\">enhancing</a> themselves, <a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\">gaining</a> the drained power, using it as <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Source\" title=\"Power Source\">power source</a> etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p><p>Unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">life-force</a> absorption, user doesn't merely absorb life-force but rather any/all forms of life in their entirety, thus making them both connected and one with life itself.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLife_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Empowerment\" title=\"Absorption Empowerment\">Absorption Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Evolution\" title=\"Assimilative Evolution\">Assimilative Evolution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Animancy\" title=\"Animancy\">Animancy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Absorption\" title=\"Biological Absorption\">Biological Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Enhanced\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Enhanced\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Supernatural\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Entity_Absorption\" title=\"Entity Absorption\">Entity Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Empowerment\" title=\"Life Empowerment\">Life Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Link\" title=\"Life Link\">Life Link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Perception\" title=\"Life Perception\">Life Perception</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Absorption\" title=\"Mind Absorption\">Mind Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Absorption\" title=\"Soul Absorption\">Soul Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Absorption\" title=\"Symbiotic Absorption\">Symbiotic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Connection\" title=\"Symbiotic Connection\">Symbiotic Connection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vitaliscience\" title=\"Vitaliscience\">Vitaliscience</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLife_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Essence_Manipulation\" title=\"Biological Essence Manipulation\">Biological Essence Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Concept_Absorption\" title=\"Concept Absorption\">Concept Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Connection\" title=\"Life Connection\">Life Connection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Embodiment\" title=\"Life Embodiment\">Life Embodiment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLife_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Anti_Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anti Storage\">Anti Storage</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Life_Transcendence\" title=\"Life Transcendence\">Life Transcendence</a> counter this.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLife_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Monitors (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Omega (<i>Dirge of Cerberus</i>)</li>\n<li>Bolt Crank (<i>Eat-Man</i>)</li>\n<li>Scub Coral (<i>Eureka Seven</i>)</li>\n<li>Winifred, Mary and Sarah Sanderson (<i>Hocus Pocus</i>); via life potion</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://kagurabachi.fandom.com/wiki/Akemura_Soga\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:kagurabachi:Akemura Soga\">Akemura Soga</a> (<i>Kagurabachi</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLife_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Magatsumi (<i>Kagurabachi</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLife_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;us